set bgColor white
lighting soft
graphics silhouettes true
windowsize 960 720
open target.cif id 1
hide #1 atoms
cartoon #1
color #1 teal
view #1 pad 0.25 clip false
save target.png width 960 height 720 supersample 2
movie record size 960,720 supersample 2
turn y 2 180 models #1
wait 180
movie encode target.mp4 framerate 30
